      "end": 26.98
    },
    {
      "text": "they actually need to do.",
      "start": 26.98,
      "end": 28.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Do they choose mine, or",
      "start": 28.56,
      "end": 30.54
    },
    {
      "text": "go back to what they",
      "start": 30.54,
      "end": 31.34
    },
    {
      "text": "were using before?",
      "start": 31.34,
      "end": 31.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe I’ve gotta build a",
      "start": 32.82,
      "end": 33.8
    },
    {
      "text": "bit more to find that",
      "start": 33.8,
      "end": 34.6
    },
    {
      "text": "out.",
      "start": 34.6,
      "end": 34.88
    },
    {
      "text": "That’s fine.",
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 35.8
    },
    {
      "text": "But I’ve got other projects",
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 37.54
    },
    {
      "text": "I wanna work on too,",
      "start": 37.54,
      "end": 38.58
    },
    {
      "text": "so I want more to",
      "start": 38.76,
      "end": 39.68
    },
    {
      "text": "go on than how good",
      "start": 39.68,
      "end": 40.84
    },
    {
      "text": "this one looks.",
      "start": 40.84,
      "end": 41.58
    },
    {
      "text": "And if I just enjoy",
